ica"],"min":[["OS","Windows 7 or higher"],["Processor","1.7 GHz Dual Core CPU"],["Memory","2 GB RAM"],["Graphics","Intel HD Graphics"],["Storage","6 GB available space"]],"rec":[],"deck":3,"blurb":"Momentum drives this precision platformer. You run and jump across the ruins of forgotten kingdoms, then glide through the air with a physics-based flight mechanic, working toward the truth about a world a tyrant has kept hidden from its people.\n\nThe story arrives without any text, told through visuals and movement alone, and the music and sound effects shift in response to how you move. Five worlds drawn with colorful silhouettes draw on Roman, Mayan and Southeast Asian influences. It is a single-player game with full controller support, suited to players who enjoy flowing, artistic platforming and a quiet, wordless style of storytelling."}}